WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Exam day is your day; the stage is set.. Be kind to yourself, loyal to the

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
plan.. See a word seven times and it is yours.. Listening is a skill; your ear

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
is a muscle too.. Note-taking is the cheapest way to remember.. You finished one

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
text today. That is a victory.. The road to your goal passes through bus stops

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
too.. If you are tired, listen — but do not quit.. Review is the antidote to

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
forgetting.. Success is the loud sound of quiet work..
